<title>DUBAI: TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DUBAI OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the $1</p>
<p>million Dubai Open men's tournament on Wednesday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Leander Paes (India) 5-7</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Pat Cash (Australia) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 7-6 (7-4) 7-6</p>
<p>(8-6)</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Bernd Karbacher (Germany)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat 5-Carlos Moya (Spain) 2-6 6-0</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>6-Albert Costa (Spain) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>7-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Kevin Goellner (Germany) 6-2 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-2</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat David Rikl (Czech Republic) 7-5</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Hendrik Jan Davids (Netherlands) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Younes el-Aynaoui (Morocco)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>4-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Roberto Carretero (Spain)</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>Christian Rudd (Norway) beat Hernan Gumy (Argentina) 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Martin Sinner (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
